{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRSKPairInjective","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRSKPairInjective","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRSKPairSurjective","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRSKInjective"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rskPair_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rskPair_injective","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRSKPairInjective.lean#L75-L101","doc":"**`rskPair` is injective.** Entry equalities come straight out of the `Σ`-equality by\n`congrArg`; the rest is the word-level injectivity already in the corpus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.wordOfPerm_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.wordOfPerm_injective","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRSKPairInjective.lean#L67-L73","doc":"A permutation is determined by its word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.shiftT_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.shiftT_injective","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRSKPairInjective.lean#L60-L65","doc":"The `0`→`1` relabel is injective: it is a `map` of a `map` of an injective function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.eq_of_shape_and_entries","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.eq_of_shape_and_entries","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRSKPairInjective.lean#L45-L58","doc":"**Same shape, same entries, same tableau.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}